00:15:33,203 --> 00:15:37,847
sometimes when you need a job done right
you gotta go see a professional That's it!

260
00:15:37,930 --> 00:15:40,470
We gotta get a shipwright for our crew!

261
00:15:41,410 --> 00:15:43,590
Our journey's far from over, right?

262
00:15:44,850 --> 00:15:50,010
We really need someone with those
skills And the Mary isn't just our ship,

263
00:15:50,330 --> 00:15:51,448
she's our home too!

264
00:15:51,730 --> 00:15:55,259
So let's go find us a shipwright
who can keep the Mary safe!

265
00:15:57,790 --> 00:15:59,187
Well, I'm impressed.

266
00:15:59,270 --> 00:16:00,807
Whoa, he got to the point!

267
00:16:00,890 --> 00:16:02,267
That's pretty rare.

268
00:16:02,350 --> 00:16:04,267
Well, that sounds really good to me.

269
00:16:04,350 --> 00:16:05,690
Luffy, let's go do it!

270
00:16:06,490 --> 00:16:07,607
That's what I just said.

271
00:16:07,690 --> 00:16:09,567
I just hope we can find somebody good.

272
00:16:09,650 --> 00:16:11,930
We should get a musician, too.

273
00:16:12,270 --> 00:16:13,564
Let's forget that one.

274
00:16:19,810 --> 00:16:21,634
What's all the ruckus out here?

275
00:16:22,790 --> 00:16:23,620
Megway!

276
00:16:24,130 --> 00:16:28,150
Quit pushing! Come on! Stop it!
Let me go! Why are they fighting?

277
00:16:42,210 --> 00:16:43,450
Bellamy! Sargus!

278
00:16:43,610 --> 00:16:45,510
Isn't someone gonna stop them?

279
00:16:46,330 --> 00:16:47,160
No more!

280
00:16:47,790 --> 00:16:49,150
I'm begging you!

281
00:16:49,490 --> 00:16:51,567
Why are you making me do this?

282
00:16:51,650 --> 00:16:53,147
What the hell is going on?

283
00:16:53,230 --> 00:16:55,583
I've never seen Sargus bleed like that.

284
00:16:55,790 --> 00:16:57,030
Why, you ask?

285
00:16:57,310 --> 00:16:59,050
Why am I making you?

286
00:16:59,990 --> 00:17:00,820
Sargus.

287
00:17:01,370 --> 00:17:02,200
Bellamy.

288
00:17:03,570 --> 00:17:07,710
I'm making you do this because
you've made a mockery of this symbol.

289
00:17:10,990 --> 00:17:13,530
Does the Sky Island exist or not?

290
00:17:13,790 --> 00:17:16,970
Is the legendary City of Gold real or not?

291
00:17:19,410 --> 00:17:22,190
The truth doesn't really
matter now, does it?

292
00:17:22,630 --> 00:17:26,748
You play the opposing sides off each
other to twist them to your will.

293
00:17:27,110 --> 00:17:28,730
That's what I told you.

294
00:17:29,190 --> 00:17:30,290
Right, Bellamy?

295
00:17:31,850 --> 00:17:34,830
I think that's Don Quixote Don Flamingo.

296
00:17:35,230 --> 00:17:37,701
He's one of the seven warlords of the sea!

297
00:17:38,130 --> 00:17:40,407
I heard his bounty's over 300 million.

298
00:17:40,490 --> 00:17:42,630
What's a guy like him doing here?

299
00:17:42,790 --> 00:17:47,570
You've really let me down and I've got
zero tolerance for useless punks like you.

300
00:17:47,850 --> 00:17:48,970
No, not again!

301
00:17:49,270 --> 00:17:52,650
My body's moving on its own!

302
00:17:52,870 --> 00:17:56,150
I can't control it! Please! No!

303
00:18:00,690 --> 00:18:01,520
Bellamy!

304
00:18:06,770 --> 00:18:07,600
Please

305
00:18:08,910 --> 00:18:12,327
Just give me one more
chance to set things right!

306
00:18:12,410 --> 00:18:15,867
I swear we'll loyally
follow your every command.

307
00:18:15,950 --> 00:18:19,210
Bellamy Let it go, Bellamy!

308
00:18:21,370 --> 00:18:25,247
I might have lost But I've never
once acted against your principles.

309
00:18:25,330 --> 00:18:26,747
I swear on your symbol!

310
00:18:26,830 --> 00:18:29,590
Please, I had reasons for my actions.

311
00:18:30,110 --> 00:18:32,387
I couldn't just let the
Straw Hats get away.

312
00:18:32,470 --> 00:18:35,882
They were bound to find you
someday if I didn't stop them.

313
00:18:36,630 --> 00:18:38,450
What a touching sentiment.

314
00:18:38,790 --> 00:18:40,130
Such genuine loyalty.

315
00:18:40,530 --> 00:18:44,290
Your concern for my well-being
is duly noted, Bellamy.

316
00:18:46,950 --> 00:18:51,656
There's a new era quickly approaching,
so your actions here won't really matter.

317
00:18:53,630 --> 00:18:56,310
But I still have no use for you.

318
00:19:07,550 --> 00:19:11,450
He wiped out Bellamy as
easily as stomping on a baby!

319
00:19:11,710 --> 00:19:13,250
He was worth 55 million!

320
00:19:14,390 --> 00:19:16,690
The beginning is upon us.

321
00:19:16,930 --> 00:19:18,250
I suggest you prepare.

322
00:19:18,670 --> 00:19:22,547
We're drawing close to a new world in
which only true pirates can survive.

323
00:19:22,630 --> 00:19:25,250
The weak should run while they still can,

324
00:19:25,410 --> 00:19:28,087
or be swept away by the
tides of time as they

325
00:19:28,170 --> 00:19:30,699
roll back to reveal a
new era of champions!

326
00:19:52,630 --> 00:19:55,690
As you climb into the night.

327
00:19:58,770 --> 00:20:02,467
But your reflection wanes.

328
00:20:02,550 --> 00:20:04,487
Then you disappear.

329
00:20:04,570 --> 00:20:06,847
Fading so silently.

330
00:20:06,930 --> 00:20:10,787
Stay as you are.

331
00:20:10,870 --> 00:20:13,387
Don't lose your way.

332
00:20:13,470 --> 00:20:16,507
Let these words guide you.

333
00:20:16,590 --> 00:20:20,610
Don't ever look back.

334
00:20:22,610 --> 00:20:25,907
Don't give up on your dreams.

335
00:20:25,990 --> 00:20:27,247
They're windless nights.

336
00:20:27,330 --> 00:20:28,567
They come to you.

337
00:20:28,650 --> 00:20:31,307
All again and again.

338
00:20:31,390 --> 00:20:33,987
Until you see the journey through.

339
00:20:34,070 --> 00:20:36,827
You may not attend.

340
00:20:36,910 --> 00:20:39,887
I hope that you'll learn.

341
00:20:39,970 --> 00:20:42,687
To put your past behind.

342
00:20:42,770 --> 00:20:45,270
And just keep moving on.
